# Object.assign()

```js
const a = {name: '小华', age: 19, sex: '女'}
const b = {name: '小华', age: 20}
const c = Object.assign(a, b)
console.log(a)
console.log(b)
console.log(c)
// {name: '小华', age: 20, sex: '女'}
// {name: '小华', age: 20}
// {name: '小华', age: 20, sex: '女'}

```

